{"id":"586e698630de0d42","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-dyson-phillips.md","title":"Dyson–Phillips Expansion","display":"df-dyson-phillips — Dyson–Phillips Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dyson-phillips","aliases":["58-df-dyson-phillips"],"display":"df-dyson-phillips — Dyson–Phillips Expansion","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dyson-phillips"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dyson-phillips</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dyson-phillips — Dyson–Phillips Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>（Banach 空间，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T(t))_{t\\geq0}\">\\((T(t))_{t\\geq0}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span>-半群）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的生成元）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal L(X)\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal L(X)\\)</span>（有界线性算子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(t)\\in\\mathcal L(X)\">\\(S_n(t)\\in\\mathcal L(X)\\)</span>（Dyson–Phillips 第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 项）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_B(t)\">\\(S_B(t)\\)</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+B\">\\(A+B\\)</span> 生成的扰动半群）</li>\n<li>Bochner 积分用于下述算子值积分</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}zero}\\vdash S_0(t)\\coloneqq T(t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}zero}\\vdash S_0(t)\\coloneqq T(t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}successor}\\vdash S_{n+1}(t)x\\coloneqq\\int_0^t T(t-s)B S_n(s)x\\,ds\\qquad(n\\in\\omega,\\ x\\in X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}successor}\\vdash S_{n+1}(t)x\\coloneqq\\int_0^t T(t-s)B S_n(s)x\\,ds\\qquad(n\\in\\omega,\\ x\\in X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}series}\\vdash S_B(t)x\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}S_n(t)x\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}series}\\vdash S_B(t)x\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}S_n(t)x\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对有界扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，该级数在每个紧时间区间上一致地按算子范数收敛，并给出生成元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A+B\">\\(A+B\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span>-半群。</li>\n<li>原式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_kA_k\\tau(s)\">\\(\\sum_kA_k\\tau(s)\\)</span> 没有定义其算子类型，也没有把上一阶项送入扰动算子，因而不是 Dyson–Phillips 递推。</li>\n<li>无界扰动需要额外的可容许性或相对有界性条件，不包含在本定义中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$（Banach 空间，见 [[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\in\\mathcal L(X)$（有界线性算子，见 [[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"(T(t))_{t\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathcal L(X)","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(t)\\in\\mathcal L(X)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S_B(t)","display":false},{"tex":"A+B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}zero}\\vdash S_0(t)\\coloneqq T(t)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}successor}\\vdash S_{n+1}(t)x\\coloneqq\\int_0^t T(t-s)B S_n(s)x\\,ds\\qquad(n\\in\\omega,\\ x\\in X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dyson\\text{-}phillips\\text{-}series}\\vdash S_B(t)x\\coloneqq\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}S_n(t)x","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A+B","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_kA_k\\tau(s)","display":false}],"bytes":1500,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-459","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-dyson-phillips.md|58-df-dyson-phillips]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ef59807ad934771f","2ad9c248fe18df37"]}